# Project TITAN V1.2 — Menu Architecture

**Architecture Lock — Runtime Sidebar V1.3 유지 until PM approval**

## Philosophy

> **메뉴는 적게 · 기능은 깊게** (Menu Simple, Function Deep)

- Main menu: **10~12개**
- Functions expand **inside** each menu — not as separate Sidebar items
- HOME: quick start · recent work · QR entry — reduce menu hunting
- QR/NFC: same philosophy — scan → work screen

## V1.2 Main Menu (11 active)

HOME · 기준정보관리 · 입고관리 · 생산관리 · 검사관리 · 성적서관리 · 출고관리 · 이력조회 · 문서관리 · **통계관리** · **관리자**

Future (module-gated): 경리관리 · 회계관리 — @see titanV12ModuleExpansion.js

## SSoT

- **Target architecture:** `src/config/titanV12MenuArchitecture.js`
  - `V12_MAIN_MENU` · `V12_MENU_FUNCTIONS` · `V13_TO_V12_MENU_MIGRATION`
- **Runtime sidebar (current):** `menuFreezeV1.js` · `menuConfig.js` — **V1.3 freeze**

## Rules

1. **New features** — register under `V12_MENU_FUNCTIONS` target menu first
2. **Reuse existing screens** — map path in config; do not duplicate pages
3. **Statistics** — one menu · internal tabs only
4. **Admin** — includes QR 출력센터 · Smart Access 관리 (planned paths)
5. **Do NOT change Sidebar** without PM approval — architecture config only until transition

## V1.3 → V1.2 Key Changes (planned)

| V1.3 | V1.2 |
|------|------|
| 입고현황 | 입고관리 (group) |
| 작업일보 | 생산관리 (group) |
| 품질관리 | 검사관리 + 성적서관리 (split) |
| 통계조회 | 통계관리 (unified tabs) |
| 환경설정 | 관리자 (expanded) |

